# N7a: mouse-look at e1m1's start: a flick up and left, a swing right and down past the
# corridor, and an eased settle on it, each a minimum-jerk stroke ("Mouse-look"). Slop,
# the status bar, the gun and the crosshair. The camera's keys are dense (every 1/60 s).

